::  modules/market/glow/fold-wood-mint.glow -- Ecological WOOD unit!
/!  16384
|%
++  fold-wood-transfer
  |=  [sender-wood=@ud amount-wood=@ud]                 ::  conserved WOOD
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  sender remainder
  ~|  'wood-zero-transfer-refused'                      ::  positive WOOD
  ?>  (gte amount-wood 1)
  ~|  'wood-insufficient-balance'                       ::  no overdraft!
  ?>  (gte sender-wood amount-wood)
  (sub sender-wood amount-wood)
--
